Incident 005 — Missing Payment Record
Investigated an order that existed in the orders table but had no corresponding payment record.

Used a LEFT JOIN with IS NULL to identify the missing relationship.

Key Learning

SQL can be used as an Application Support troubleshooting tool to trace transactions, identify missing records, compare related data, and provide evidence for escalation.

